===Stories of Legend===
|-
| colspan="2" |</includeonly>'''Stories of Legend''' (レジェンドストーリー ''Rejendo Sutōrī'', '''Legend Story''') is the first main campaign in Legend Stages, unlocked by clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. After clearing all chapters in this part for the first time, the next part, '''Uncanny Legends''', will be unlocked.

Units with Boost Stories of Legend [[Talent Orbs]] have increased health and attack power in Stories of Legend, becoming more powerful the higher the Orb's Rank. When two Boost Stories of Legend Orbs are equipped by the same unit, only one takes effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.

